Wire the iOS app shell into LUS (reference 0012, rebased): LUS calls
SohIos_OnWindowCreated right after SDL creates its window. The shell lives
in the Starship-ios repo (passed as -DSOH_IOS_SHELL_DIR). Symbol name kept
reference-verbatim for harbour-shell uniformity.

